  m_Name: Elena - Contract
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Elena - Contract
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Detective Miller:</b>\r\n\"You mentioned your working relationship
    with Marcus was perfectly fine. We found this in his wastebasket. A Vance Wealth
    Management liquidation contract, dated yesterday.\"\r\n\r\n<b>Elena Vance:</b>\r\n\"Standard
    contingency paperwork. As a stakeholder, it is my fiduciary duty to prepare for
    all financial outcomes, including bankruptcy. A drafted proposal is not a crime,
    Inspector.\"\r\n\r\n''[Investigator's Note:]'' There's definitely something more
    to this story. She was clearly hiding something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
